msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Sissejuhatus"

msgid "What is the addressbook?"
msgstr "Mis on aadressiraamat?"

msgid "The addressbook application is part of your I2P installation."
msgstr "Aadressiraamatu rakendus on osa sinu I2P paigaldusest."

msgid "It regularly updates your hosts.txt file from distributed sources or \"subscriptions\"."
msgstr "See uuendab regulaarselt sinu hosts.txt faili hajutatud allikatest ehk \"tellimustest\"."

msgid "Subscribing to additional sites is easy, just add them to your <a href=\"subscriptions\">subscriptions</a> file."
msgstr "Tellimuste lisamine teistele saitidele on lihtne – lisa need lihtsalt oma <a href=\"subscriptions\">tellimuste</a> faili."

msgid "For more information on naming in I2P, see <a href=\"http://i2p-projekt.i2p/naming.html\" target=_blank>the overview</a>."
msgstr "Lisainfo nimeandmete kohta I2P-s: <a href=\"http://i2p-projekt.i2p/naming.html\" target=_blank>ülevaade</a>."

msgid "How does the addressbook application work?"
msgstr "Kuidas aadressiraamatu rakendus töötab?"

msgid "The addressbook application regularly polls your subscriptions and merges their content into your \"router\" address book."
msgstr "Aadressiraamatu rakendus kontrollib regulaarselt sinu tellimusi ja liidab nende sisu sinu \"rooteri\" aadressiraamatusse."

msgid "Then it merges your \"master\" address book into the router address book as well."
msgstr "Seejärel liidab see ka sinu \"põhi\" aadressiraamatu rooteri aadressiraamatusse."

msgid "If configured, the router address book is now written to the \"published\" address book, which will be publicly available if you are running an eepsite."
msgstr "Kui see on seadistatud, kirjutatakse rooteri aadressiraamat nüüd \"avaldatud\" aadressiraamatusse, mis on üldkättesaadav, kui käitad eepsaidi."

msgid "The router also uses a private address book, which is not merged or published."
msgstr "Rooter kasutab ka privaatset aadressiraamatut, mida ei liideta ega avaldata."

msgid "Hosts in the private address book can be accessed by you but their addresses are never distributed to others."
msgstr "Privaatses aadressiraamatus olevaid hoste saad sina kasutada, kuid nende aadresse ei jagata kunagi teistele."

msgid "The private address book can also be used for aliases of hosts in your other address books."
msgstr "Privaatset aadressiraamatut saab kasutada ka teiste aadressiraamatute hostide aliaste jaoks."

msgid "subscription log"
msgstr "tellimuste logi"

msgid "Subscription Log"
msgstr "Tellimuste logi"

msgid "Most recent (excluding bad domains)"
msgstr "Kõige uuemad (halvad domeenid välja jäetud)"

msgid "subscriptions"
msgstr "tellimused"

msgid "The subscription file contains a list of i2p URLs."
msgstr "Tellimuste fail sisaldab i2p URL-de loendit."

msgid "The addressbook application regularly checks this list for new eepsites."
msgstr "Aadressiraamatu rakendus kontrollib seda loendit regulaarselt uute eepsaidide leidmiseks."

msgid "Those URLs refer to published hosts.txt files."
msgstr "Need URL-id viitavad avaldatud hosts.txt failidele."

msgid "See the FAQ for a list of subscription URLs."
msgstr "Tellimuste URL-de loendi leidmiseks vaata FAQ-d."
